Epoch_1b_parentWithdraw
├── given the active strategy is local to Parent
├── and a depositor has claimed Yieldcoin shares from a prior epoch
├── and the epoch has net withdrawals
├── when CRE closes the epoch through WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should withdraw USDC from the local adapter
├── and ParentVault should mark the epoch claimable
├── and ParentVault should open the next epoch
└── and the withdrawer should claim USDC while shares are burned
